title: 'security: Bump litep2p to 0.15.2 to fix panic in WebRTC'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
  description: |-
    litep2p 0.15.2 fixes a panic in the WebRTC transport that could be triggered
    remotely by sending oversized UDP datagrams to a WebRTC endpoint.

    Only nodes with the WebRTC transport enabled are affected. Operators of such
    nodes are advised to upgrade.

    See the [litep2p v0.15.2 release notes](https://github.com/paritytech/litep2p/releases/tag/v0.15.2)
    for details.
crates:
  - name: sc-network
    bump: patch
    validate: false
  - name: sc-network-types
    bump: patch
    validate: false
